# Full-resolution image originals staged for processing. Never committed:
# the repo holds web derivatives only (AGENTS.md). Drop files here and the
# optimized versions land in src/assets/.
_staging/

# Agent working files. The project brief (AGENTS.md) holds internal facts —
# contact details, facility finances, client-permission notes — and stays
# on this machine only. CLAUDE.md is its pointer and goes with it.
# WORKFLOW.md is Jackson's own reference for the git, image, and deploy
# machinery. It contains no secrets, but it describes what the private
# files hold, so it stays local rather than advertising them in a public
# repo. Move it out of this list if you ever want it published.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
WORKFLOW.md
